{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18738","headline":"壮士行 · 刘禹锡","name":"壮士行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴风振寒郊，猛虎正咆哮。\n徐行出烧地，连吼入黄茅。\n壮士走马去，镫前弯玉弰。\n叱之使人立，一发如铍交。\n悍睛忽星堕，飞血溅林梢。\n彪炳爲我席，羶腥充我庖。\n里中欣害除，贺酒纷呶号。\n明日长桥上，倾城看斩蛟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}